This file contains all the functions of my API. Be sure to write the API before the: API::"function"

API::Init_Engine()   Initializes the window and writes values to shader and vertex buffers. Returns a window - so assign it to a variable of type GLFWwindow*

API::Init_Uniforms()   Initializes variables that will change for shapes

API::Close_Window(GLFWwindow* window)   Closes the window when the ESC is pressed

API::Keys_Movement(GLFWwindow* window)   Enables camera movement and rotation, everything works by pressing the WASD and Arrow buttons

API::Clear_Screen()   Clears the buffer of colors and shader, or just the screen

API::Vertex_Buffer()   Loads shader buffer

API::Create_Camera()   Creates a camera

API::Create_Perspective()   Creates a perspective for camera

API::Create_Cube()   Creates a cube

API::Create_Platf()   Creates a box or plotform

API::Create_Triangle()   Creates a Pyramid

API::Limitation_View()   Makes a viewing angle limit

API::Clear_Buffer(window)   Clears all buffers

API::Destroy_Engine(window)   Completes the program
